+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: A.MaxRate ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |   Projection: A.MaxRate, count(Int64(1)) AS Count                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[A.MaxRate]], aggr=[[count(Int64(1))]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |       Projection: A.MaxRate                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |         Inner Join: A.NumberSid = B.NumberSid                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |           SubqueryAlias: A                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |             TableScan: number_info projection=[NumberSid, MaxRate], full_filters=[number_info.AccountSid = LargeUtf8("AC8ee2a82cf11c7c8860b192678c9e3066"), number_info.NumberPoolSid = LargeUtf8("NPe85ca269e9eb6b9268ffeab9d6ffaba9"), number_info.NumberRegion = LargeUtf8("US"), number_info.NumberType = LargeUtf8("lc"), number_info.AreaCodeRegion = LargeUtf8("617"), number_info.NumberSid != LargeUtf8("PN00000000000000000000000000000099"), number_info.AvailableForNumberSelection = Int8(1) OR number_info.AvailableForNumberSelection = Int8(0)]                                                                                                |
|               |           SubqueryAlias: B                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |             TableScan: number_caps projection=[NumberSid], full_filters=[number_caps.Capability = LargeUtf8("sms"), number_caps.NumberSid != LargeUtf8("PN00000000000000000000000000000099")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [MaxRate@0 ASC NULLS LAST]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |   SortExec: expr=[MaxRate@0 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |     ProjectionExec: expr=[MaxRate@0 as MaxRate, count(Int64(1))@1 as Count]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |       AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[MaxRate@0 as MaxRate], aggr=[count(Int64(1))]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |         RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([MaxRate@0], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |           AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[MaxRate@0 as MaxRate], aggr=[count(Int64(1))]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |             HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(NumberSid@0, NumberSid@0)], projection=[MaxRate@1]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |               RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([NumberSid@0], 32), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
